msgstr "选中此框将导致 Font Awesome 库装入包含锐利实心图标声明的文件 (<i>sharp-solid.js/sharp-solid.css</i>)"

msgid "Load custom icons"
msgstr "装入定制图标"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the custom icon declarations (<i>custom-icons.js/custom-icons.css</i>)"
msgstr "选中此框将导致 Font Awesome 库装入包含定制图标声明的文件 (<i>custom-icons.js/custom-icons.css</i>)"

msgid "Version 4 Backwards Compatibility"
msgstr "V4 向后兼容性"

msgid "Version 5 of Font Awesome has some changes which require modifications to the way you declare many of your icons. The settings below are designed to ease that transition. See @upgradingLink for more information."
msgstr "Font Awesome V5 进行了一些更改，需要您修改众多图标的声明方式。 下面的设置旨在简化该转换。 请参阅 @upgradingLink 以获取更多信息。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to upgrading version 4 to version 5"
msgstr "将 Font Awesome V4 升级到 V5 的指南"

msgid "Use version 4 shim file?"
msgstr "是否使用 V4 shim 文件？"

msgid "Rather than editing all of your Font Awesome declarations to use the new Font Awesome syntax, you can choose to include a shim file above. This file will allow you to use Font Awesome version 5 with Font Awesome version 4 syntax. This prevents you from needing to modify your existing code and syntax."
msgstr "您可以选择包含上面的 shim 文件，而不是编辑所有的 Font Awesome 声明以使用新的 Font Awesome 语法。 此文件允许您将 Font Awesome V5 与 Font Awesome V4 语法结合使用。 这样就不需要修改现有的代码和语法。"

msgid "External / local Library Location"
msgstr "外部/本地库位置"

msgid "Enter a source URL for the external / local (relative path) Font Awesome v4 shim file you wish to use. This URL should point to the Font Awesome JS shim file. Leave blank to use the default Font Awesome CDN."
msgstr "输入要使用的外部/本地（相对路径）Font Awesome v4 shim 文件的源 URL。 此 URL 应指向 Font Awesome JS shim 文件。 留空以使用缺省 Font Awesome CDN。"

msgid "Bypass Font Awesome icon validation?"
msgstr "是否绕过 Font Awesome 图标验证？"

msgid "If enabled, icon name validation will not take place. This is useful when using custom icons from Font Awesome's hosted kits."
msgstr "如果启用此选项，那么将不会进行图标名称验证。 当使用 Font Awesome 托管套件中的定制图标时，这很有用。"

msgid "Invalid external library location."
msgstr "外部库位置无效。"

msgid "Insert Font Awesome Icon"
msgstr "插入 Font Awesome 图标"

msgid "Drupal Font Awesome"
msgstr "Drupal Font Awesome"

msgid "Layers are the new way to place icons and text visually on top of each other, replacing the Font Awesome classic icons stacks. With this new approach you can use more than 2 icons. Layers are awesome when you don’t want your page’s background to show through, or when you do want to use multiple colors, layer several icons, layer text, or layer counters onto an icon. Note that layers only work with the SVG version of Font Awesome. For more information, see @layersLink."
msgstr "分层是将图标和文本直观地放置在彼此之上的新方法，取代了 Font Awesome 经典图标堆栈。 通过此新方法，您可以使用 2 个以上的图标。 当您不想让页面的背景显示出来，或者当您想使用多种颜色，将多个图标、文本或计数器分层放置到一个图标上时，分层效果非常棒。 请注意，分层仅适用于 SVG 版本的 Font Awesome。 有关更多信息，请参阅 @layersLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to layers"
msgstr "Font Awesome 分层指南"

msgid "Display multi-value fields as layers: <strong>@layersSetting</strong>"
msgstr "将多值字段显示为层：<strong>@layersSetting</strong>"

